IPC-Unix

this is a lousy rewrite because i don't like IPC::Run's syntax


INSTALLATION

To install this module, run the following commands:

	perl Makefile.PL
	make
	make test
	make install

SUPPORT AND DOCUMENTATION

After installing, you can find documentation for this module with the
perldoc command.

    perldoc IPC::Unix



